_608/h_576/1069/107851/2022/9/9/231979.png\" style=\"width:333px;height:315px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">新手：那是不是要马上要练？</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">答：再看看她的活动相性</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><img data-width=\"652\" data-height=\"259\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_652/h_259/1069/107851/2022/9/9/626907.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_652/h_259/1069/107851/2022/9/9/626907.png\" style=\"width:333px;height:132px;\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"></div><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">WB相性S，Raid相性B，其它为D</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">表示这个天子属于WB特化型，PvP活动不适合</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">raid活动只作为补位型（没有关键角色）</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\">可以在暗WB前练，并不着急</div></span><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">没在活动相性表内的角色，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">因为其上位角色的存在，故只推荐过渡使用</span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">看清楚拿到角色的技能再考虑是否放在队内，因为每期活动必有活动作业，所以不要着急</span></span></span></span></div></span></div></span></span></span></div>\n                               </div><br><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\" style=\"\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">万能小队</div>\n