span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">）</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"824\" data-height=\"1464\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_824/h_1464/1069/107851/2023/1/12/614712.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_824/h_1464/1069/107851/2023/1/12/614712.png\"></div><br></div></div></div></div>\n                               </div><br><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">天子活动相性</span></div></div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">更新时间：<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">202<span style=\"\">3-7</span></span></span></span></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:24px;font-weight:700;\">7-7</span>：全属性根据现有活动进行微调</span><br></div><div style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><br></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: initial;\">相性标准：超出预期=</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">S</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: initial;\">、表现不错=</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">A</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: initial;\">、可被取代=</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">B</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: initial;\">、可有可无=</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">C</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: initial;\">、完全不行=</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">D</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">结合培养价值表食用更佳，过气角色请勿盲从，大佬有的是资源，但萌新没有，请把资源花在刀刃上</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">至于其它没上榜的角色，因为其上位角色的存在，故只推荐过渡使用，你也不想看到全是D评价的角色占满整个榜单吧，请结合上面的培养价值一起用吧，两个表看好角色相性再根据实际用途去培养</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"text-decoration-line: underline;\">因为是以图片形式保存更新会稍慢，在线文档应该会及时些</span>，点这里→</span><a href=\"https://docs.qq.com/sheet/DYUROaEhmSVJwRXNk?tab=r8g26m&amp;u=76f894aa789d4b0b87533c980bd2dea1\" style=\"font-weight: 700;\">活动相性</a><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">(<span style=\"color:rgb(255,0,0);font-size:24px;font-weight:700;\">23-7</span>)</span><br></div><div style=\"\"><br></div></span><div><div class=\"selectItem fold-model-container\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                                \n                                <div class=\"fold-title-wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"icon-btn\"></i>\n                                    <div class=\"input-div\" contenteditable=\"true\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:16px;font-weight:700;\">光(2-12)</span></div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"fold-content\" contenteditable=\"true\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1304\" data-height=\"2168\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1304/h_2168/10